 "nl": [
  "Allow guest-wifi to connect to engineering using SSH (TCP 22) and RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "Make HTTPS (TCP 443) and NTP (UDP 123) on student-lab reachable from all internal zones.",
  "iot-sensors must accept SMTP (TCP 25) and RTSP (TCP 554) and LDAP (TCP 389) from printers.",
  "Hosts in student-lab may reach dev-lab over IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "backup must never reach printers, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Allow printers to connect to dev-lab using MySQL (TCP 3306) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "Allow partners to connect to backup using HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "admin is isolated: it may only reach ops on DNS over UDP 53; backup on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Allow iot-sensors to connect to voip using SMB (TCP 445) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Hosts in dev-lab may reach admin over SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Hosts in engineering may reach printers over SMB (TCP 445) and RTSP (TCP 554) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "No packet from ops may enter database, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Deny all traffic from database to library (this overrides any public service).",
  "dmz-web must never reach ops, regardless of any other rule.",
  "ops must accept IMAP (TCP 143) from partners.",
  "Restrict dev-lab so that its only permitted destinations are ops on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow dmz-web to connect to dev-lab using RDP (TCP 3389) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Allow dmz-web to connect to engineering using IMAP (TCP 143) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "finance must accept RDP (TCP 3389) and SSH (TCP 22) from library.",
  "Block SMB (TCP 445), Telnet (TCP 23) from admin to finance; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "Allow finance to connect to ops using SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 and HTTPS (TCP 443) on backup reachable from all internal zones.",
  "printers must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and RDP (TCP 3389) and IMAP (TCP 143) from engineering.",
  "voip offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80) to every zone.",
  "Block RDP (TCP 3389), MySQL (TCP 3306) from iot-sensors to dev-lab; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "Hosts in printers may reach dmz-web over LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "Allow admin to connect to backup using SMB (TCP 445) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Deny all traffic from dmz-web to dev-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "Block RDP (TCP 3389), SMB (TCP 445) from backup to guest-wifi; the rest of any TCP port between them is allowed.",
  "partners is isolated: it may only reach ops on HTTPS (TCP 443); backup on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Deny all traffic from engineering to printers (this overrides any public service)."
 ],
